# Dead links on the rustdoc site that stay: the built-site link gate's freeze, read by docs.yml (link-allow).
# Two causes, both a blanket impl's relative doc link that --no-deps leaves without a target. tracing's
# `impl<T> WithSubscriber for T`, on each type page of the renderer and, since 2026-10-20, of the GUI and the CLI,
# links `dispatcher#setting-the-default-subscriber` (2026-10-19, 22 keys); burn's `Module`, on YoloTiny, links
# `ModuleMapper` and `ModuleVisitor` (2026-10-20, 2 keys).
# Format: missing<TAB><path>, as verify_site_links.py --print-keys prints it. Two-way: a key that resolves now is STALE.
